			"strokeColor": "#3fb950",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"text": "from pydantic import (\n    BaseModel, Field\n)\n\n▸ BaseModel = parent class\n  for all data models\n▸ Gives validation, parsing,\n  serialization (.model_dump())\n▸ Field = extra constraints\n  (e.g. min_length=1)",
