			"strokeColor": "#d29922",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"text": "OutputItem(BaseModel):\n    prompt: str\n    name: str\n    parameters: dict[str, Any]\n\n▸ The result of decoding one prompt\n▸ prompt = original prompt text\n▸ name = selected function name\n▸ parameters = extracted params (Any type\n  because they can be str/float/bool)\n▸ .model_dump() serializes to JSON\n▸ Example:\n  { \"prompt\": \"Greet shrek\",\n    \"name\": \"fn_greet\",\n    \"parameters\": { \"name\": \"shrek\" } }",
			"fontSize": 9,
			"fontFamily": 3,
