			"text": "📥 JSON file → load_json_file() → raw dicts\n    ↓\n📋 _validate_model(FunctionDefinition, data) → list[FunctionDefinition]\n📋 _validate_model(PromptItem, data) → list[PromptItem]\n    (both use model_validate() from BaseModel)\n    ↓\n🔧 decoder.decode() → returns DecodedCall{name, parameters}\n    ↓\n📤 OutputItem(prompt, name, parameters)\n    ↓\n📄 .model_dump() → JSON dict → write_output() → .json file",
